  <entry>
    <id>https://publish.obsidian.md/testvault/Publish+handling+test</id>
    <title>Publish handling test</title>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://publish.obsidian.md/testvault/Publish+handling+test"/>
    <published>2026-10-12T14:56:00.464Z</published>
    <updated>2026-10-12T14:56:00.464Z</updated>
    <summary type="text">Probe for how Publish renders Obsidian syntax.</summary>
    <content type="html">&lt;h1&gt;Publish handling test&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Links&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Published link: &lt;a href=&quot;https://publish.obsidian.md/testvault/Embedded+note&quot;&gt;Embedded note&lt;/a&gt;. Aliased: &lt;a href=&quot;https://publish.obsidian.md/testvault/Embedded+note&quot;&gt;the alias&lt;/a&gt;. Heading link: &lt;a href=&quot;https://publish.obsidian.md/testvault/Embedded+note#Embedded%20note&quot;&gt;Embedded note &gt; Embedded note&lt;/a&gt;. Block link: &lt;a href=&quot;https://publish.obsidian.md/testvault/Embedded+note#%5Eabc&quot;&gt;Embedded note &gt; ^abc&lt;/a&gt;.
Unpublished link: Secret draft. Aliased unpublished: hidden alias. Missing note: Does not exist.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Embeds&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Published note embed: &lt;a href=&quot;https://publish.obsidian.md/testvault/Embedded+note&quot;&gt;Embedded note&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Unpublished note embed: &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Image embed: &lt;img src=&quot;https://publish-01.obsidian.md/access/b314572814760ecbbede3e77005135aa/test-image.png&quot; alt=&quot;test-image.png&quot;&gt; and sized: &lt;img src=&quot;https://publish-01.obsidian.md/access/b314572814760ecbbede3e77005135aa/test-image.png&quot; alt=&quot;test-image.png&quot; width=&quot;100&quot;&gt; and alt: &lt;img src=&quot;https://publish-01.obsidian.md/access/b314572814760ecbbede3e77005135aa/test-image.png&quot; alt=&quot;my alt&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Markdown image: &lt;img src=&quot;https://publish-01.obsidian.md/access/b314572814760ecbbede3e77005135aa/test-image.png&quot; alt=&quot;md alt&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Syntax&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;mark&gt;Highlighted&lt;/mark&gt; text, a #sometag and a  here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Callout title&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Callout body.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Foldable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Folded body.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;contains-task-list&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;task-list-item&quot; data-task-char=&quot; &quot;&gt;&lt;input type=&quot;checkbox&quot; disabled&gt; todo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;task-list-item&quot; data-task-char=&quot;x&quot;&gt;&lt;input type=&quot;checkbox&quot; checked disabled&gt; done&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Inline math &lt;code class=&quot;language-math math-inline&quot;&gt;x^2&lt;/code&gt; and block:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-math math-inline&quot;&gt;E = mc^2&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Footnote&lt;sup&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#user-content-fn-1&quot; id=&quot;user-content-fnref-1&quot; data-footnote-ref aria-describedby=&quot;footnote-label&quot;&gt;1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-js&quot;&gt;const code = &quot;%%not a comment%%&quot;;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;section data-footnotes class=&quot;footnotes&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;sr-only&quot; id=&quot;footnote-label&quot;&gt;Footnotes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li id=&quot;user-content-fn-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The footnote. &lt;a href=&quot;#user-content-fnref-1&quot; data-footnote-backref=&quot;&quot; aria-label=&quot;Back to reference 1&quot; class=&quot;data-footnote-backref&quot;&gt;↩&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;</content>
  </entry>
